  (https://github.com/ZiyaoLi/fast-kan, commit
  17b65401c252334fffb5e63c9852dd8316d29e69, Apache License 2.0, Copyright
  2024 Li, Ziyao)
- OrthogPolyKANs, LegendreKANLayer
  (https://github.com/Boris-73-TA/OrthogPolyKANs, commit
  3b2760a7def56122dafaef53ad7ac3aa87804826; no license file at that commit)
- Wav-KAN, KANLinear (https://github.com/zavareh1/Wav-KAN, commit
  f7ab5215e69b1a32e9e289159d2fd55d078fa051, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024
  Zavareh Bozorgasl)
- rational_activations, Rational_PYTORCH_B_F
  (https://github.com/ml-research/rational_activations, commit
  2496d918d924b117ef06ec35bdca7f207720c62c, MIT License, Copyright 2020
  ml-research@TUDarmstadt)
- JacobiKAN, JacobiKANLayer (https://github.com/SpaceLearner/JacobiKAN,
